invalid type: string "Supplier Risk Management Policy\nVersion: 2026.1\n\nSupplier risk should be assessed using delivery performance,\npayment incidents, historical risk events and supplier ratings.\n\nA supplier should be considered elevated risk when two or more\nserious delivery delays occur within a six-month period.\n\nA delivery delay of 7 days or more is considered material.\n\nssessments.